{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校始まったー！\nまた毎朝早く起きないと行けない。\nがんばるっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後メンバー、スタッフさんと\n乃木神社にお参りしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじは小吉だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいのか悪いのか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は1月7日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七草粥を食べる日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさん聞いて？！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...作りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...私が！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、頑張ったろおおおお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊藤家はいつも玄米を使っているので\nできあがりはお粥にしては\nちょっと硬かった。ので、\nお母さんはまた煮込みましたが...\n美味しかった。それなりに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっあー！\nねねに自慢しよ←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは七草粥食べましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今欲しい物は何ですか!?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー...特にこれというのはないけど\nハンドメイドのブローチ！\nブローチとか集めてるから"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンドメイドっていうなら自分で\n作れやって話だけどね笑\n美容グッズも気になってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新規まりっ会の会員は\nまず何をすればよいですか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか推しでいてくださるだけで\nもうとっても嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まじめに、たまにゆるーくね！\nまりっ会に入会してくれて\nありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家ではよく、こんな\nルームウェアとか着るの？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...え！\n......え、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"着てない...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"子供扱いされたらやっぱり\nイラ立ちますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"慣れてる。もん...\n子供じゃないいいうあああ！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、でも大人っぽくきれいに\nなりたいって本気で思ってるよ。うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表の記事、\nコメントありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部読みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送を見た直後に\n思ったことそのまま書こうとしたけど\nぐちゃぐちゃしちゃって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強がった文しか書けませんでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんと喜び合いたい気持ち\nだけではなく、\n気持ちを共有することって\n大切ですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって一緒に坂を登ってるんだもの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強がってる私も\n弱気な私も\n受け入れてくださるみなさんが\n本当にだいすきです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キリッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャープに見える！わあい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/08/5193386/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}